---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到" description="该页面不存在，或地址已经变更。">
  <section class="page-intro wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">404 / NOT FOUND</p>
    <h1>这条链接没有找到。</h1>
    <p class="lede">地址可能写错，或页面已被移除。你可以回到首页，或从指南目录继续浏览。</p>
    <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/">回到首页</a><a class="button button-outline" style="color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--line)" href="/guides/">查看指南</a></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
